host cloud pier — Eastern (EDT) time convention
title CAUM6 — the desk archive: a bounded log that keeps a sequence of proven recordings in order
prompt recur the 1024-round itinerary Lindy-first crux-first; take the next agent-doable lap on the road past BUHR, self-approve design rounds, send each finished increment as its own signed round, stop at custody gates
think CAUM5 proved the carry meets end to end, but the desk inbox keeps only the last accepted frame — accept overwrites its single slot. A field recorder is many recordings; a desk that forgets all but the newest is not the desk a keeper needs. Lindy-first crux-first, the most durable next move within the module family is a bounded archive that keeps a sequence in arrival order.
think The crux is the bounded append held to verify-before-keep across many: deposit deframes first and appends only on a clean deframe within both bounds; a corrupt frame anywhere refuses by name and leaves the whole archive exactly as it was (no partial write, no disturbed prior entry); two bounds — max_entries and a max_bytes budget — each refuse ArchiveFull before a byte passes them.
think mikrophone/archive.rye stands on CAUM1's wire.deframe, inventing no transport. A packed byte store plus a bounded index of (off, len) entries; deposit checks the entry count, checks the byte need in u64 so the sum cannot wrap, then copies with a plain bounded loop. entry_at reads the i-th recording bounded by the count; clear zeroes the whole store.
obs The sharp invariants: three framed takes read back byte-for-byte in arrival order; a tampered frame handed to a non-empty archive refuses DigestMismatch and the archive stands unchanged (count and prior entry intact); a seventeenth entry refuses ArchiveFull; eight whole-session payloads exactly fill max_bytes (8×max_samples) and a ninth refuses ArchiveFull with used still at the budget; clear leaves count zero and the store entirely zero.
obs Custody untouched — a frame is still a byte slice handed function to function; a durable content-addressed store on real flash (beading a recording into Tablecloth) is a later rung that composes this shape with the tree's artifact store. Real hardware, a real desk, a real disk stay custody gate #2; no custody gate reached.
loom witness=caum_archive_witness cases=5 result=GREEN tame=clean width=exit0
