file work-in-progress/REMEMBER.md living edge advanced CAUM5→CAUM6, the CAUM sentence extended with the bounded archive, git nib refreshed in this same work commit
recommend keep-going the desk now keeps a bounded archive; next agent-doable Season-A rungs stay pure — beading an accepted recording into the tree's content-addressed store (Tablecloth), or the archive meeting a Skate/glass surface (a scrollable list of takes); no custody gate until a board or provisioning is reached
